      "cr": 0.125,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Liberated Toads cohort sheet — Index T.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-liberated-toads-actors.py</code> from the Pond Patrol docket (<code>data/liberatedToadsSystem.json</code>, snapshot Highsun 24, 1040 BF): level 2 on the docket → CR 1/8 on the Commoner line (ordinary toads without specialized training, but with potential) — the docket defines no scholar class, so the cohort feat carries the trade; robes (AC 10), hit points 2d6. A GM-ready reading of the docket, not a filed stat line; the docket stays the authority.</p><p><strong>The Chroniclers</strong> — Record keeping, intelligence analysis, education, history preservation. Leader: Scribe Dewdrop. Scholars and scribes who maintain the faction's records, analyze intelligence, and preserve the stories of liberation. They ensure nothing is forgotten.</p><p><strong>On the docket:</strong> Cross-reference desk, level 2 (a T-pun name). <q>Everything links to everything.</q></p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Equipment</strong> — Writing supplies, Archive materials, Cipher books (the weapon items)</li><li><strong>Specialisations</strong> — Documentation, Intelligence analysis, Education (the cohort feat)</li><li><strong>Commoner</strong> — classDefinitions.commoner: Survivor's Instinct (L1); Strength in Numbers (L2)</li><li><strong>Status</strong> — active: Documenting current crisis extensively</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      },
